    {"id":"open-disagreement-poetry","op":"open","cohort":"holdout","terms":["君子和而不同","和而不流","相观而善之谓摩","忠告而善道之","和实生物，同则不继"],"focus":"在合作中保留分歧而不伤和同：可读“和而不同”“相观而善”与谏诤、义理取舍之文，思考如何既协作又不违心附和。","scope":["core","poetry"],"exclude":[],"previousQuotes":[],"gold":[[{"sourceId":"rysxguji-lunyu-13-23","corpusVersion":"guji-core-v1","textHash":"d5c68e956f667ca1f7792b68ca7a51780521385d9c6c505322bdcf0b2e76550e","start":4,"end":17,"quote":"君子和而不同，小人同而不和"}],[{"sourceId":"rysxguji-zhongyong-1-11","corpusVersion":"guji-core-v1","textHash":"2ccd62122fb02fa0d2a61749565473d8ada93c2f47dc4ef837ce9dc68b5fbdeb","start":0,"end":7,"quote":"故君子和而不流"},{"sourceId":"rysxguji-liji-29-10","corpusVersion":"guji-core-v1","textHash":"3453f28237cef44c2d9c3678e7bdd496e6461c34c35255ebb69a82e44db860aa","start":67,"end":74,"quote":"故君子和而不流"}]]},
